{
 "id": "seg5a",
 "title": "回滚与Gas",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 93.42,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5a-00",
   "text": "最后一块基础，是 gas 和回滚。",
   "spoken": "最后一块基础，是 gas 和回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 1.699,
   "speechEnd": 4.236
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-01",
   "text": "每条指令都消耗 gas。gas 用完，当前调用帧回滚。",
   "spoken": "每条指令都消耗 gas。gas 用完，当前掉用帧回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-01.wav",
   "start": 4.62,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 4.72,
   "speechEnd": 9.219
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-02",
   "text": "require 和自定义错误，会回滚当前调用，并向上冒泡。",
   "spoken": "require 和自定义错误，会回滚当前掉用，并向上冒泡。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-02.wav",
   "start": 9.64,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 9.737,
   "speechEnd": 14.476
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-03",
   "text": "低级 call 失败却不冒泡，只返回 false 和返回数据。",
   "spoken": "低级 call 失败却不冒泡，只返回 false 和返回数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-03.wav",
   "start": 14.9,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 14.997,
   "speechEnd": 18.644
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-04",
   "text": "try catch 只能接住外部调用的失败，接不住本合约内部的失败。",
   "spoken": "try catch 只能接住外部掉用的失败，接不住本合约内部的失败。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-04.wav",
   "start": 19.04,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 19.133,
   "speechEnd": 23.977
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-05",
   "text": "外部调用，最多转发剩余 gas 的 64 分之 63。被调用方耗尽 gas，调用方还剩 64 分之 1 来收尾。",
   "spoken": "外部掉用，最多转发剩余 gas 的 64 分之 63。被掉用方耗尽 gas，掉用方还剩 64 分之 1 来收尾。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-05.wav",
   "start": 24.38,
   "dur": 9.28,
   "speechStart": 24.473,
   "speechEnd": 33.424
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-06",
   "text": "这里有一个过时的习惯。transfer 和 send 只转发 2300 gas，曾经被当成防重入的手段。",
   "spoken": "这里有一个过时的习惯。transfer 和 send 只转发 2300 gas，曾经被当成防虫入的手段。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-06.wav",
   "start": 33.88,
   "dur": 8.72,
   "speechStart": 33.973,
   "speechEnd": 42.364
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-07",
   "text": "后来 gas 价格改过几次。接收方是合约钱包时，这种转账会直接失败。",
   "spoken": "后来 gas 价格改过几次。接收方是合约钱包时，这种转账会直接失败。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-07.wav",
   "start": 42.82,
   "dur": 6.08,
   "speechStart": 42.82,
   "speechEnd": 48.695
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-08",
   "text": "现在推荐的做法，是用 call 转账，再用 CEI 或重入锁来防重入。",
   "spoken": "现在推荐的做法，是用 call 转账，再用 CEI 或虫入锁来防虫入。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-08.wav",
   "start": 49.12,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 49.12,
   "speechEnd": 54.722
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-09",
   "text": "gas 规则还在变。Fusaka 和尚未上线的 Glamsterdam，都会打破固定 gas 够用的假设。",
   "spoken": "gas 规则还在变。Fusaka 和尚未上线的 Glamsterdam，都会打破固定 gas 够用的假设。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-09.wav",
   "start": 55.18,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "speechStart": 55.18,
   "speechEnd": 62.58
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-10",
   "text": "编译器也在变。0.8 以前，算术默认不检查溢出，必须用 SafeMath。",
   "spoken": "编译器也在变。0.8 以前，算术默认不检查溢出，必须用 SafeMath。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-10.wav",
   "start": 63.0,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 63.104,
   "speechEnd": 69.086
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-11",
   "text": "0.8.24 起，支持瞬态存储，可以做低成本的重入锁。跨链部署前，要确认目标链支持。",
   "spoken": "0.8.24 起，支持瞬态存储，可以做低成本的虫入锁。跨链部署前，要确认目标链支持。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-11.wav",
   "start": 69.54,
   "dur": 9.36,
   "speechStart": 69.64,
   "speechEnd": 78.67
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-12",
   "text": "把这一集放在一起看，就是一句话：每一次调用，都可能把控制权交给别人。",
   "spoken": "把这一集放在一起看，就是一句话：每一次掉用，都可能把控制权交给别人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-12.wav",
   "start": 79.12,
   "dur": 7.04,
   "speechStart": 79.218,
   "speechEnd": 85.212
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-13",
   "text": "交给了谁，用的是谁的存储，失败时谁回滚，都要自己看清楚。",
   "spoken": "交给了谁，用的是谁的存储，失败时谁回滚，都要自己看清楚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep03/audio/lines/seg5a-13.wav",
   "start": 86.38,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 86.38,
   "speechEnd": 92.028
  }
 ],
